  "research_notes": "Iteration 18 appraise complete. Accepted: IFN-low PTEN-STAT3 replication; IFN-high PTEN-STAT3 effect-modification interaction (dataset-specific, practical lower bound borderline); hypoxia-low KEAP1-NFE2L2 replication; high-stemness replication of all five core accepted associations. Rejected/closed: POLR2A-SMARCA4 specificity; KRAS, EGFR, and ERBB2 BRAF-V600E pathway-bypass probes. Validation capacity is zero. The robust core set remains SMARCA4 loss with stronger SMARCA2 dependency, KEAP1 loss with weaker NFE2L2 dependency, MSI-high with stronger WRN dependency, PTEN loss with stronger STAT3 dependency, and TP53 loss with weaker USP7 dependency, with broad internal replication across tested strata and one accepted IFN-high amplification interaction for PTEN-STAT3."
