ing-context or off-target effects. For IFN interaction claims, direction -1 encodes amplification of the raw negative PTEN-loss STAT3 dependency effect. For low-Cas9 ARID1A, direction -1 encodes expected stronger SMARCA2 dependency if ARID1A were biologically relevant, but anticipated_direction 0 reflects the prior null. Interpret all returned estimates as signed. Invalid cell sizes are non-assessable, not evidence of absence. All interpretations remain association statements limited to the supplied dataset and not causal or generalizable biological claims."
