\nInterpretation rules: signed estimates must be evaluated as already signed to registered direction; accept only if interval excludes zero and magnitude is meaningful, using roughly 0.10 dependency-score-unit benchmark. Cell-size invalid comparisons are non-assessable, not negative evidence. Avoid causal language and avoid claiming generalizability beyond this supplied dataset."
